 \u003cmgaudet@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1860193 - Verify we get a script from a function before asking for the filename r=mccr8, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D203836", "files": ["js/xpconnect/src/XPCComponents.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "34d4c2f3caa4bd235d959a75703f4f0f528a2375", "parents": ["d60b2c9c9adf5c40c2a3b0330dd331b15c0c1637"], "tags": []}], "date": 1711831997, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "319": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr115 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D206232", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "35f3e7db120153f7572a28726193622715dbbdb2", "parents": ["34d4c2f3caa4bd235d959a75703f4f0f528a2375"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Steve Fink \u003csfink@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1885779 - Canonicalize BigInts read through structured clone  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D205661\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D206168", "files": ["js/src/vm/BigIntType.h", "js/src/vm/StructuredClone.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "05ab058811bf716fb0552469fb806b1206a22542", "parents": ["35f3e7db120153f7572a28726193622715dbbdb2"], "tags": []}], "date": 1711984161, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "320": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jed Davis \u003cjld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1884347 - Fix unprivileged userns detection to handle new a AppArmor feature.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D204326\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D205134", "files": ["security/sandbox/linux/SandboxInfo.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1c004a56518cc7500f1ffac92e50b11013cb2bf6", "parents": ["05ab058811bf716fb0552469fb806b1206a22542"], "tags": []}], "date": 1712003173, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "321": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrew Osmond \u003caosmond@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1886855 - Add pref to allow disabling fallback for GMP updates.  a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D206358", "files": ["modules/libpref/init/all.js", "toolkit/modules/GMPInstallManager.sys.mjs", "toolkit/modules/GMPUtils.sys.mjs"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "350d0dff7f4f8277b259ddc602df31f01573d6fb", "parents": ["1c004a56518cc7500f1ffac92e50b11013cb2bf6"], "tags": []}], "date": 1712065295, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "322": {"changesets": [{"author": "Barret Rennie \u003cbarret@brennie.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1884039 - Include a surveyVersion for Nimbus legacyHeartbeat  a=RyanVM\n\nThe surveyVersion field is included in telemetry and is required by the\ningestion schema. Because that field has been omitted for Nimbus\nlegacyHeartbeat experiments, no heartbeat pings have been submitted. We now\nhardcode the surveyVersion for all Heartbeats coming from Nimbus.\n\nA test has been added to ensure that Nimbus-triggered Heartbeats submit a\npayload that matches the Telemetry schema.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D205239\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D206364", "files": ["toolkit/components/normandy/actions/ShowHeartbeatAction.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/normandy/lib/LegacyHeartbeat.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/normandy/test/browser/browser_LegacyHeartbeat.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2ca503d0d03c8a046319c2b80da5a169a76daae0", "parents": ["350d0dff7f4f8277b259ddc602df31f01573d6fb"], "tags": []}], "date": 1712067052, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "323": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1839263 - Fix python configure lint on python \u003e= 3.10. r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,ahochheiden,sergesanspaille, a=test-only DONTBUILD\n\nPython 3.10 added some more arguments to the CodeTypes constructor. It\nalso changed co_lnotab to co_linetables.\n\nWe were using co_lnotab to simulate a function with a def at a specific\nline and a raise at a specific other line. I'm not sure how I ended up\nwith this particular requirement (this may have been related to python 2\nstill being used back then), but as of now, it doesn't seem we need the\ndef to be at a specific location, so we can avoid needing to generate\na co_linetables/co_lnotab, relying instead on the raise expression being\non the co_firstlineno+1 in the thrower function.\n\nAs for the extra arguments, it turns out python 3.8 also introduced a\nCodeType.replace method that can be used to derive a CodeType object\nfrom another, which is certainly simpler than calling its construtor\nwith the right set of arguments.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D181424", "files": ["python/mozbuild/mozbuild/configure/lint.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "813fda3a3ebb149e034826d0978cf468ec581154", "parents": ["2ca503d0d03c8a046319c2b80da5a169a76daae0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1712068404, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "jcristau@mozilla.com"}, "324": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1839263 - Don't derive assertRaisesFromLine from assertRaises. r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,ahochheiden, a=test-only DONTBUILD\n\nIn python 3.11 (maybe also 3.10, I haven't tested that version ; 3.9 was\ndefinitely different), by the time the context manager comes back in our\nassertRaisesFromLine, the traceback is not available anymore (or yet,\nI'm not entirely sure which way it does) to inspect and check the line\nnumbers we want to check.\n\nAnd while assertRaises exposes the thrown exception in its `exception`\nattribute, it also resets the traceback associated with it, so we can't\nfind it there either.\n\nSo instead, we implement our own context manager for\nassertRaisesFromLine such that we can access that traceback.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D181425", "files": ["python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/configure/test_lint.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "43e02b858c49033d98a2c9105c2767100ad4719f", "parents": ["813fda3a3ebb149e034826d0978cf468ec581154"], "tags": []}], "date": 1712070348, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "jcristau@mozilla.com"}, "325": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1840533 - Forbid @imports(\"__builtin__\"). r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,andi,sergesanspaille, a=test-only DONTBUILD\n\nThe last use of importing the whole __builtin__ module was removed in\nbug 1264831... 7 years ago.\n\nNow that it actually doesn't work anymore with recent releases of\ncpython, we might as well kill it for good.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D182140", "files": ["python/mozbuild/mozbuild/configure/__init__.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/configure/test_configure.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "01b1012936be019034a4e016ff3ddf697f5a46a0", "parents": ["43e02b858c49033d98a2c9105c2767100ad4719f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1712074005, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "jcristau@mozilla.com"}, "326": {"changesets": [{"author": "Barret Rennie \u003cbarret@brennie.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1889157 - Dont use Promise.withResolvers in browser_LegacyHeartbeat.js r=chumphreys a=RyanVM\n\nBug 1884039 introduced a new test that used Promise.withResolvers, but this API\nis not present in ESR115.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D206391", "files": ["toolkit/components/normandy/test/browser/browser_LegacyHeartbeat.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1abbb99d9877e53841ee169bf1604423c95e29aa", "parents": ["01b1012936be019034a4e016ff3ddf697f5a46a0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1712082165, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "327": {"changesets": [{"author": "Barret Rennie \u003cbarret@brennie.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1889157 - Do not await heartbeat.noticePromise in browser_LegacyHeartbeat.js r=chumphreys a=RyanVM\n\nBug 1845150 refactored all usages of the notification box, including the one\nused in Normandy's heartbeat implementation. These changes are not available on\nESR115. The test has been updated to not reference these changes.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D206416", "files": ["toolkit/components/normandy/test/browser/browser_LegacyHeartbeat.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "7c440f656a5065016b3a68fdee670b4936e6a067", "parents": ["1abbb99d9877e53841ee169bf1604423c95e29aa"], "tags": []}], "date": 1712151264, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "328": {"changesets": [{"author": "Calixte \u003ccdenizet@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1887320 - Correctly handle lines when pasting some text in a freetext  a=RyanVM\n\nBackport of upstream PR:\nhttps://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js/pull/17852\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D205982\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D206368", "files": ["toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/build/pdf.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "659645ad3f8ab5034c3d71285ea66d5fec25a8c1", "parents": ["7c440f656a5065016b3a68fdee670b4936e6a067"], "tags": []}], "date": 1712156599, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "329": {"changesets": [{"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@intuitionlibrary.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1883932 - Add R16 support to texture upload pool  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D203973\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D206555", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/renderer/upload.rs"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e941114698b0e93603185a4b2b84e36bbc8fd148", "parents": ["659645ad3f8ab5034c3d71285ea66d5fec25a8c1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1712192899, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "330": {"changesets": [{"author": "Gijs Kruitbosch \u003cgijskruitbosch@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1866100 - improve PromptUtils activeness handling,  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D200165\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D206619", "files": ["toolkit/components/prompts/src/PromptUtils.sys.mjs"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "887520530f6e8604b9621618a060829ffad457c8", "parents": ["e941114698b0e93603185a4b2b84e36bbc8fd148"], "tags": []}], "date": 1712238011, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "331": {"changesets": [{"author": "Olli Pettay \u003cOlli.Pettay@helsinki.fi\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1886056, traverse and unlink/invalidate Navigator::mClipboard,  a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D206591", "files": ["dom/base/Navigator.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "55bc43f71a480d315f014648edcf36064f9c0ff7", "parents": ["887520530f6e8604b9621618a060829ffad457c8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1712238082, "git_changesets": [nu